flowchart TD

    A["Input data<br>In: scRNA-seq FASTQ + metadata (TSV, CSV)<br>Out: FASTQ + metadata"] --> B["STARsolo alignment<br>In: FASTQ + metadata; reference genome + GTF<br>Out: CB/UB BAM + BAI"]
