    E --> F["Somatic-like gene-burden features<br>In: long TSV<br>Out: gene-burden matrix (TSV, CSV)"]
    F --> G["ML: WE vs UWE<br>In: gene-burden matrix + labels (metadata)<br>Out: CV metrics + permutation p-values"]
    B --> I["cellsnp-lite<br>In: CB/UB BAM + barcodes + VCF<br>Out: per-cell AD/DP matrices (MTX) + variants.tsv"]
    I --> J["Cluster aggregation<br>In: cellsnp outputs + cell->cluster map (TSV)<br>Out: per-cluster counts (TSV)"]
    F --> H["Correlation with mutational analysis<br>In: gene-burden + cluster counts + mutational outputs<br>Out: correlation/enrichment stats (TSV) + FDR"]
    J --> H
    C --> M["Mutational analysis outputs<br>In: filtered VCF<br>Out: SNV/indel burden; signatures; drivers; pathway enrichment (TSV)"]
    M --> H
